  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction1": "Use this recipe to craft a §6Advanced",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction10": "Advanced = gold, Rare = emerald,",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction11": "Precious = diamond. The amount",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction12": "depends on the scroll's enchant",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction13": "level. Also, taking out has a 35%",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction14": "chance to fail. On failure, the",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction15": "scroll and minerals are consumed,",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction16": "but no finished item is given.",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction2": "§6Enchant Smithing Table§r, the only",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction3": "way to apply Advanced Enchants to",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction4": "items. It has three input slots:",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction5": "Slot 1: the equipment to enchant,",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction6": "Slot 2: an enchant scroll, Slot 3:",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction7": "minerals. Take out the enchanted",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction8": "item. The mineral type depends on",
  "gui.compendium.page4.introduction9": "the scroll tier: Ordinary = iron,",
  "gui.compendium.page4.title": "1. Smithing Table",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction1": "Use this recipe to craft a §6Advanced",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction10": "the levelup ball of the matching",
