  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction12": "upgraded with ender pearls. If a tool",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction13": "lacks enough Advanced Enchant slots,",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction14": "use a Slot Builder to add slots. Each",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction15": "level of the Slot Builder adds one",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction16": "slot.",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction2": "§6Enchant Anvil§r. It can upgrade",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction3": "Advanced Enchant levels and also the",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction4": "enchant slots of items. It has three",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction5": "input slots: Slot 1, the equipment",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction6": "to upgrade; Slot 2, the upgrade",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction7": "materials. Then take out the finished",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction8": "item. Forging never fails here. To",
  "gui.compendium.page5.introduction9": "upgrade an enchant's level, you need",
  "gui.compendium.page5.title": "2. Anvil",
  "gui.compendium.page6.introduction1": "Use this recipe to craft a §6Advanced",
  "gui.compendium.page6.introduction10": "Smithing Table to enchant items with",
